:'''Sunday, Saturday''': [[Fight Area]]
:'''Monday''': [[Eterna City]]
:'''Tuesday, Friday''': [[Hearthome City]]
:'''Wednesday, Thursday''': [[Jubilife City]]
* In Pokémon Platinum, there is data for a {{pkmn|battle}} with Reporter Kinsey with a [[level]] 6 {{p|Shinx}}, but it is completely inaccessible.<ref>https://www.smogon.com/forums/threads/pokemon-platinum-trainer-data.3665884/</ref>
* In {{g|Ultra Sun and Ultra Moon}}, Reporter Rita's English name may be a reference to {{wp|Rita Skeeter}} from the {{wp|Harry Potter}} franchise.

